<title>USA: Oxford approves Barnett merger.</title>
<headline>Oxford approves Barnett merger.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oxford Resources Corp said on Thursday that its shareholders approved a merger with Barnett Banks Inc at a special meeting of Oxford shareholders.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement, Oxford shareholders will receive 0.9085 shares of Barnett common stock for each share of Oxford common stock, Oxford said.  It is anticipated that the merger will close promptly upon the satisfaction of certain closing conditions, the company said.</p>
<p>Oxford Resources is a specialized automobile finance company that also remarkets the automobiles upon the expiration of the leases, Oxford said.</p>
</text>
